<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for your interest in the graduate programs within the School of Molecular Sciences at Arizona State University.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">The School of Molecular Sciences offers PhD degrees in both <a href="https://sms.asu.edu/node/10">chemistry</a> and <a href="https://sms.asu.edu/node/13">biochemistry</a>, and all admitted students are <a href="https://sms.asu.edu/admission/graduate-admissions/financial-support">fully funded</a>, including the cost of tuition, health insurance and a competitive stipend.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Applications are accepted for study beginning in fall semesters only. The application will be available beginning September 1 for admission to the following fall and the application deadline is January 1. We do not admit students for the spring semester. The application is made up of <a href="https://sms.asu.edu/admission/graduate-admissions/how-apply">two parts</a>: a general graduate application through the graduate admissions office and a supplemental application to the School of Molecular Sciences.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">We are a growing program that is <a href="https://sms.asu.edu/research">conducting cutting edge, interdisciplinary research</a> to solve societal problems at the molecular level, and I encourage you to check out the research being conducted by our faculty. I hope you will consider joining us.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you have questions about the application process or graduate programs that are not included on our website, please email me and I will be happy to assist you.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Good luck in your pursuit of graduate studies.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">David Nutt</font></div><div><font face="arial">Graduate Programs Coordinator</font></div><div><font face="arial">School of Molecular Sciences</font></div><div><font face="arial"><a href="mailto:smsgrad@asu.edu">smsgrad@asu.edu&nbsp;</a></font></div><div><font face="arial">480-965-4664</font></div><div><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;">{!Case.Thread_Id}</span></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>